<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 4.6</h2>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Create, edit, and delete board task cards.</li>
<li>Type board cards as a session/task union.</li>
<li>Expose board task cards over the WebUI bridge.</li>
<li>Store task cards alongside session cards.</li>
<li>Add expanded transcript terminal docking.</li>
<li>Support nested OpenCode model IDs end to end.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li>Virtualize live chat transcript.</li>
<li>Keep composer typing and sidebar drags off the transcript render path.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Preserve cancellation during environment probing.</li>
<li>Bound environment probing and cancel stale launches.</li>
<li>Treat a durable task save as saved and queue task writes behind the lock.</li>
<li>Narrow search context after task-card rebase.</li>
<li>Keep restored task timestamps and publish the gate&#x27;s blocked state.</li>
<li>Surface recovered delete failures and cover the mutation gate.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.6">https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.6</a></p>
</div>
